Write a solution to find the percentage of the users registered in each contest rounded to two decimals.
Return the result table ordered by percentage in descending order. In case of a tie, order it by contest_id in ascending order.


SOLUTION:

SELECT Register.contest_id,
    ROUND((COUNT(Register.contest_id) / (SELECT COUNT(Users.user_id) FROM Users) * 100), 2) AS percentage
FROM Register LEFT JOIN Users ON Users.user_id = Register.user_id
GROUP BY Register.contest_id
ORDER BY percentage DESC, Register.contest_id ASC
